# Editing `docs/*.md`

**Workflow and LLM rules:** See **`.cursor/rules/lupfr-context-engineering.mdc`** (always on).

- **Canonical set only:** OVERVIEW, ARCHITECTURE, DESIGN, REQUIREMENTS, API, DEPLOYMENT, TESTING. No feature-specific docs; no duplicate spec files elsewhere.
- **Append-first:** Prefer new subsections over parallel documents; use OVERVIEW to point readers to the right file.
- **Pair with code:** Spec updates that describe runtime behavior should ship with the code that implements them.
